planner += '</dl><p id="model-note"></p>'+p('學生自行購買或團購的教材款不列入此試算。教師專用設備若需新購，現金餘額以整筆購置取代攤提，避免重複扣除。未列入押金、稅款、融資、退款及額外啟動成本；保險、行銷等請納入固定成本。退款或折扣會降低收入。','Independent and group purchases of student kits are excluded from this model. For instructor equipment, the cash view replaces allocation with the full purchase, avoiding double counting. Deposits, taxes, financing, refunds and additional launch costs are excluded. Add insurance and marketing to fixed costs; refunds and discounts reduce revenue.')+'</div></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>'+''.join('<th>'+bi(z,e)+'</th>' for z,e in [('人數','Learners'),('每堂營收','Revenue / session'),('每堂餘額','Balance / session'),('整梯餘額','Balance / block')])+'</tr></thead><tbody id="scenario-rows"><tr><td>6</td><td>$180</td><td>−$12</td><td>−$72</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>$240</td><td>$24</td><td>$144</td></tr><tr class="highlight"><td>10</td><td>$300</td><td>$60</td><td>$360</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>$360</td><td>$96</td><td>$576</td></tr></tbody></table></div>'+p('公式：每堂餘額＝人數 × [每生每堂學費 × (1 − 抽成比例) − 每生耗材] − 固定成本。損益兩平人數向上取整。自租模式以金流費取代市府分潤，並在固定成本加上完整租用時數。','Formula: balance = learners × [per-session tuition × (1 − deduction rate) − per-learner supplies] − fixed costs. Break-even rounds up. Rental mode replaces the city share with payment processing and adds all booked room hours to fixed costs.','small')+'</section>'
planner += '<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">'+p('04 / A PILOT WE CAN LEARN FROM','04 / A PILOT WE CAN LEARN FROM','eyebrow')+heading('招生、設備與一年安排。','Enrollment, equipment and the year ahead.')+'<div class="three">'
for zh,en,dz,de in [('人數與教學配置','Group size & staffing','1 位老師單獨帶班，建議先限 6–8 人；10–12 人安排助教。試辦目標 10 人，上限先設 12 人。這是教學配置建議，不是法定師生比。若多數為 K 或需要較多協助，減少名額並重算成本。','For a solo instructor, start with 6–8 learners; use an assistant for 10–12. Target 10 and cap the pilot at 12. These are teaching recommendations, not statutory ratios. Reduce enrollment and recalculate costs if many learners need more support.'),('學生教材與團購','Student kits & group orders','原廠 10 套組頁面列 US$999.95，查詢時顯示缺貨待補。每位學生自行購買一套，或湊滿 10 位有購買需求的同學協調團購；平均每套約 US$100，另計適用稅運費。教材歸學生所有，不由課程學費支付。實際供貨、收款與分配方式須在下單前確認。','The manufacturer lists the ten-pack at US$999.95 and showed it as backordered when checked. Each learner purchases one kit independently, or ten classmates needing kits can coordinate a ten-pack order: approximately US$100 per kit before applicable tax and shipping. Kits belong to students and are not paid from tuition. Confirm availability, payment and distribution before ordering.'),('全年與續班判斷','Year plan & continuation','6 梯 × 6 堂＝36 堂；以 US$180 固定價計，30 堂學年 $900、暑期 $180、全年 $1,080／生，均不含教材且非承諾售價。試辦後檢查出席、每人操作機會、除錯表達、續報意願與實際工時，再決定是否續開。','Six blocks × six sessions = 36. At a constant proposed US$180/block: school year $900, optional summer $180, full year $1,080 per learner. These are tuition-only planning totals, excluding kits, not committed prices. Review attendance, hands-on turns, debugging explanations, return interest and actual staff time before continuing.')]:
    planner += '<article class="feature">'+heading(zh,en,3)+p(dz,de)+'</article>'
planner += '</div>'+p('以預設分潤模型、每梯均 10 人且全年 36 堂計：營收 $10,800，扣除分潤、師資、耗材與行政後，營運及現金餘額均為 $2,160（教師設備預算為 $0）。每位學生的教材費另由家庭支付，不列為課程營收，也不扣成課程成本。這說明單班較適合作為驗證課程與招生需求的試辦；若期待更高盈餘，應提高實際續班率、改善合作條件或另開班，而非無償吸收備課工時。','With the default partnership model, ten paid learners per block and 36 sessions: revenue is $10,800 and operating and cash balances are both $2,160 after staff, supplies, overhead and city share, with no new instructor equipment budgeted. Families pay for their own kits; those purchases are neither course revenue nor course costs. A single class is mainly a pilot for curriculum and demand. Larger earnings require stronger retention, better terms or another class, with preparation time still paid.','note')+'</section>'
planner += '<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">'+p('05 / NEXT CONVERSATION WITH NKCC','05 / NEXT CONVERSATION WITH NKCC','eyebrow')+heading('帶著具體提案，洽談開班條件。','Bring a concrete proposal to NKCC.')+'<ul class="checklist">'
for zh,en in [('合作方式：能否以市府課程承包方式辦理？分潤基礎、比例、場地、報名與退款成本各由誰負擔？','Partnership: is a contracted city course possible? Confirm revenue-share basis, percentage and responsibility for room, registration and refunds.'),('時段與空間：週三下午 50 分鐘，另留布置、接送與收拾時間；需容納十套個人教材的工作桌與測試空間；如需教師示範／備用套組，另行編列。','Space and timing: 50 minutes on Wednesday afternoons, plus setup, pickup and cleanup; work areas and testing space for ten individual kits; budget separately for any instructor demonstration or spare kits.'),('招生設定：提案 8 人起班、10 人目標、12 人上限；確認居民／非居民定價、適用費用、取消與補課規則。','Enrollment: propose minimum 8, target 10, maximum 12; confirm resident/nonresident rates, applicable fees and cancellation/makeup terms.'),('人員安排：確認實際主教／助教、資格與中心要求；助教若需更多工時，先調整預算。','Staff: confirm the lead, assistant, qualifications and center requirements; increase the budget if the assistant needs more paid time.'),('日期與授課語言：核對學校週三放學及交通時間、假期、中文支援與家長需求後，才公布確切開課日期。','Dates and language: verify Wednesday school dismissal, travel time, breaks, Mandarin support and family needs before publishing start dates.')]:
    planner += '<li>'+bi(zh,en)+'</li>'
planner += '</ul>'+p('場地洽詢：North Kirkland Community Center · 425-587-3350 · <a href="mailto:eParks@kirklandwa.gov">eParks@kirklandwa.gov</a>。此頁未代為聯絡或提交申請。','Venue contact: North Kirkland Community Center · 425-587-3350 · <a href="mailto:eParks@kirklandwa.gov">eParks@kirklandwa.gov</a>. No inquiry or application has been sent.')+link(PROPOSAL,'官方課程提案表（使用前確認最新版本） ↗','City course proposal form (confirm current version) ↗','inline-link')+'</section>'
planner += '<section class="section" style="padding-top:0" id="sources">'+p('SOURCE NOTES','SOURCE NOTES','eyebrow')+heading('資料來源與使用範圍。','Sources & scope.')+'<ol class="sources">'
sources = [
 (GUIDE,'City of Kirkland · Fall 2026 / Winter 2027 Youth Guide','印刷頁 22–25：比較課程、年齡、日期與價格。透過官方手冊頁取得連結並下載解析。','Printed pages 22–25: comparison courses, ages, dates and fees. Linked from the city guide page and downloaded for review.'),
 (RENTAL,'City of Kirkland · Facility Rental Guide · 2026-05-26','第 4、6 頁：NKCC 多功能室費率、最低時數與押金；不等於商業課程合約報價。','Pages 4 and 6: room rates, minimum hours and deposit; not a commercial teaching contract quote.'),
 (KIT,'Thames & Kosmos · Classroom Bundle 10-Pack','US$999.95 與供貨狀態；與 ref 中的產品 PDF 相互參照，實際採購另確認稅運費。','US$999.95 and availability; cross-checked with the supplied product PDF. Confirm tax and shipping when purchasing.'),
 ('https://thamesandkosmos.com/pages/educator-resources','Thames & Kosmos · Educator Resources','參考原廠教材對照與 ref 內課程關聯 PDF，未宣稱本原創課程獲 CSTA 認證。','Manufacturer curriculum correlations and the supplied PDF inform the design; no CSTA certification of this original course is claimed.'),
 ('https://www.facebook.com/PecuLabLLC','PecuLab · 課程理念 / Program philosophy','依使用者提供的 ref/Facebook.pdf：故事、文化任務、不插電邏輯、修正與表達。','Based on the supplied ref/Facebook.pdf: stories, cultural tasks, screen-free logic, revision and explanation.'),
 ('https://secure.rec1.com/WA/city-of-kirkland/catalog','City of Kirkland · REC1 live catalog','即時頁面自動讀取受阻（403）；報名與最新價格仍須回到官方目錄確認。','Automated access was blocked (403); verify live pricing and registration in the official catalog.')]
for url,name,dz,de in sources:
    planner += f'<li><a href="{url}">{name}</a><br>{bi(dz,de)}</li>'
planner += '</ol></section></div>'

videos = '<section class="section" id="demos"><div class="container"><div class="section-top"><div>'+p('SEE IT IN ACTION','SEE IT IN ACTION','eyebrow')+heading('看看機器人，<br>怎麼讓指令動起來。','See the robot<br>bring instructions to life.')+'</div>'+p('從指令卡到地圖，看看這套教材的實際操作。點選播放即可觀看，也可以切換全螢幕。','Watch the kit in action with physical command cards and a map. Select play to watch, or switch to full screen.')+'</div><div class="demo-grid">'
for number, title_zh, title_en, duration in [('01','指令卡操作示範','Command card demonstration','0:07'),('02','地圖行走示範','Robot on the map','1:09')]:
    videos += f'<article class="demo-card"><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" width="1280" height="720" poster="assets/demo-{number}-poster.jpg" aria-labelledby="demo-title-{number}"><source src="ref/coding-robotics-demo-{number}.mp4" type="video/mp4">'+bi('您的瀏覽器不支援內嵌影片，請使用下方連結開啟。','Your browser does not support embedded video. Use the link below to open it.')+f'</video><div class="demo-caption"><div class="module-head"><h3 id="demo-title-{number}">'+bi(title_zh,title_en)+f'</h3><span class="tag">{duration}</span></div>'+link(f'ref/coding-robotics-demo-{number}.mp4','另開影片 ↗','Open video ↗','inline-link')+'</div></article>'
videos += '</div></div></section>'
overview = overview.replace('<section class="section" id="curriculum">', materials + videos + '<section class="section" id="curriculum">')
(ROOT/'index.html').write_text(shell(overview),encoding='utf-8')
